# Ignore node_modules to prevent large build contexts and platform mismatches
**/node_modules

# Ignore build artifacts
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

# Ignore git metadata
**/.git

# Ignore environment variables (security)
**/.env

# Ignore Python cache and virtual environments
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/venv
**/.venv

# Ignore IDE settings
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store